1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,477
That note only reached her yesterday

2
00:00:03,355 --> 00:00:04,628
James Windibank

3
00:00:05,284 --> 00:00:07,350
Then I can wait in the next room.

4
00:00:08,108 --> 00:00:10,616
But it might have been
a cry of surprise.

5
00:00:11,722 --> 00:00:12,983
And is that all?

6
00:00:13,382 --> 00:00:16,018
I was preoccupied with
business matters.'

7
00:00:16,815 --> 00:00:18,965
I already feel it closing in upon me.

8
00:00:19,317 --> 00:00:21,300
How did your mother take the matter?

9
00:00:21,619 --> 00:00:22,815
It's about Isa.

10
00:00:23,883 --> 00:00:25,105
Is he quiet?

11
00:00:25,431 --> 00:00:27,199
Five attempts have been made.

12
00:00:27,784 --> 00:00:30,462
you do find it very hard
to tackle the facts.

13
00:00:30,789 --> 00:00:31,998
Who are you?

14
00:00:33,122 --> 00:00:34,348
You know me, then?

15
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,812
Every clue seems to slip
through my fingers.

16
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:40,820
the other answered with
the utmost coolness.

17
00:00:41,464 --> 00:00:42,943
What I cannot understand

18
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,345
Rucastle that she could
do nothing with him.

19
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,491
I trust that we are not too late

20
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,736
and, above all, why did
you not come at once?

21
00:00:52,658 --> 00:00:55,029
I have already arranged
what is to occur.

22
00:00:55,377 --> 00:00:58,408
Then I shall drop you a line to
let you know how we progress.

23
00:00:59,224 --> 00:01:00,692
I am delighted to see you

24
00:01:01,554 --> 00:01:02,810
This is my point.

25
00:01:03,841 --> 00:01:06,618
He is looking up at the
numbers of the houses.

26
00:01:07,418 --> 00:01:10,639
Then, pray tell me what it is
that you can infer from this hat?

27
00:01:11,105 --> 00:01:13,968
My room at The Cedars
is a double-bedded one.

28
00:01:14,431 --> 00:01:15,673
'You have destroyed it!

29
00:01:16,237 --> 00:01:18,236
'The Copper Beeches, near Winchester.

30
00:01:18,723 --> 00:01:21,769
If she can come to Winchester
to meet us she can get away.
